Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Japanese record mixing and Trainer Hill
Applies after 0059-japanese-name-length.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Two differences of the Japanese ROM's own logic: it never refuses to mix records
(only the international games refuse Japanese ones), and its Trainer Hill has no
"closed until the game is cleared" state, so the attendant and the two visitors
skip it (their three texts are not in that ROM).

diff --git a/data/maps/TrainerHill_Entrance/scripts.inc b/data/maps/TrainerHill_Entrance/scripts.inc
index 48b1680..2ec19b1 100644
--- a/data/maps/TrainerHill_Entrance/scripts.inc
+++ b/data/maps/TrainerHill_Entrance/scripts.inc
@@ -120,7 +120,10 @@ TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_AttendantEnd::
 TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_EntryTrigger::
 	lockall
 	applymovement LOCALID_PLAYER, TrainerHill_Entrance_Movement_PlayerFaceAttendant
+@ The Japanese Trainer Hill has no "closed until the game is cleared" state (nor its three texts).
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE != LANGUAGE_JAPANESE
 	goto_if_unset FLAG_SYS_GAME_CLEAR, TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_Closed
+#endif
 	msgbox TrainerHill_Entrance_Text_WelcomeToTrainerHill, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
 	trainerhill_getsaved
 	call_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_SaveGame
@@ -219,7 +222,9 @@ TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_Records::
 	end
 
 TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_Man::
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE != LANGUAGE_JAPANESE
 	goto_if_unset FLAG_SYS_GAME_CLEAR, TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_ManTrainerHillClosed
+#endif
 	msgbox TrainerHill_Entrance_Text_WhatSortOfTrainersAreAhead, MSGBOX_NPC
 	end
 
@@ -228,7 +233,9 @@ TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_ManTrainerHillClosed::
 	end
 
 TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_Girl::
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE != LANGUAGE_JAPANESE
 	goto_if_unset FLAG_SYS_GAME_CLEAR, TrainerHill_Entrance_EventScript_GirlTrainerHillClosed
+#endif
 	msgbox TrainerHill_Entrance_Text_FriendsTryingToReachTimeBoardTop, MSGBOX_NPC
 	end
 
diff --git a/src/cable_club.c b/src/cable_club.c
index 571f097..fa4021d 100644
--- a/src/cable_club.c
+++ b/src/cable_club.c
@@ -678,6 +678,11 @@ static void Task_ValidateMixingGameLanguage(u8 taskId)
             {
                 mixingForeignGames = TRUE;
             }
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_JAPANESE
+            // Only the international games refuse to mix records with Japanese ones:
+            // the Japanese ROM has no such check (nor CableClub_Text_CantMixWithJapaneseGame).
+            mixingForeignGames = FALSE;
+#endif
 
             if (mixingForeignGames)
             {
